/P 273 0 R
/T (The use of an interference fit to circumvent the need for clamping & adhesives is possible but require careful consideration not to overstress & damage the stator or rotor. Therefore it is not recommended over the use of axial clamping or bonding. Alva should be consulted before a interference fit is implemented.)
/E (The use of an interference fit to circumvent the need for clamping & adhesives is possible but require careful consideration not to overstress & damage the stator or rotor. Therefore it is not recommended over the use of axial clamping or bonding. Alva should be consulted before a interference fit is implemented.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [18]
>>
