<<
/Title (A large gap bonding method can also be used if desired. Stator to rotor alignment can either be achieved by use of spacers\(spacers are not included\) in the airgap OR combine a clearance fit with a glue groove. Note that spacer method require the rotor \(alternatively a dummy rotor\) to be pre-mounted on the rotor carrier while the stator is glued in place & vice versa. A general structural adhesive with good gap filling capabilities should be used. In applications with high power demands a thermally conductive adhesive is required\(such as the MG chemicals 8329 TFS\).)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 18832 0 R
>>
endobj
